; Dependency spec for the --extern-import fixture (commit 6). Its minted extern-interface export is
; consumed by tests/extern-import/consumer/lib.cddl TWO ways — via a physical hand-stub and via
; --extern-import pointing at the export — and the generated consumer output must be byte-identical.
; Exercises an opaque class-backed row (foo -> _CDDL_CODEGEN_EXTERN_TYPE_) and a transparent alias
; (coin -> coin = uint), the two shapes a consumer resolves across the crate boundary.
foo = [a: uint, b: text]
coin = uint
